can find the images of the vectors in the standard basis ${i,j,k}$ by computing the matrix products $T\\cdot i,$ $T\\cdot j,$ and $T\\cdot k:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(i) & =T\\cdot i=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 3 \\\\ -1 & -4 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\ T(j) & =T\\cdot j=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 3 \\\\ -1 & -4 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}] \\\\ T(k) & =T\\cdot k=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 3 \\\\ -1 & -4 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533494 17592186045585 true] [17592186403940 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403941 13194139533494 17592186045585 true] [17592186403940 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403942 13194139533494 17592186045585 true] [17592186403940 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403943 13194139533494 17592186045585 true] [17592186403940 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403944 13194139533494 17592186045585 true] [17592186403940 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403945 13194139533494 17592186045585 true] [17592186403940 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533494 17592186045585 true] [17592186403940 1077 "selection" 13194139533494 17592186045585 true] [17592186403940 1079 #edb/ref 17592186403942 13194139533494 17592186045585 true] [17592186403940 1080 #uuid "2ca28029-c6f3-5a49-a225-50f9f49023d0" 13194139533494 17592186045585 true] [17592186403941 1081 "$[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]$, $[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$, and $[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$" 13194139533494 17592186045585 true] [17592186403941 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533494 17592186045585 true] [17592186403941 1084 #uuid "2f67d4a5-627c-56f2-b3cf-643aa6d04321" 13194139533494 17592186045585 true] [17592186403942 1081 "$[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -1\\end{a